<item><title>Guinea raises monthly sanitation budget for Conakry communes to 15 billion francs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-raises-monthly-sanitation-budget-for-conakry-246862/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-raises-monthly-sanitation-budget-for-conakry-246862/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The minister puts the real monthly cost at 23 billion francs for Conakry and 109 billion nationwide, against the old 3 billion to 3.5 billion.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:47:45 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-raises-monthly-sanitation-budget-for-conakry-246862/share.jpg" length="43895" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-raises-monthly-sanitation-budget-for-conakry-246862/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
